SUMMARY:Misc Connections: An Olio House Party
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're looking for new friends\, lovers\, or someone wi
 th a boat\, we're here to make it happen for you. One of our favorite part
 s of running Olio (a miscellaneous collection of art + people) is making c
 onnections between our members based on their niche hobbies\, interests\, 
 or that certain je ne sais quoi.&nbsp\;Become a member to join the party\,
  and you'll enter a whole new world of connections through an evening of c
 urated conversation groups and a dance floor to boogie.&nbsp\;What to expe
 ct:8pm: You're matched with new friends to discuss a few curated prompts a
 nd meet the others in the space.9:30pm-midnight: Hang with your new friend
 s\, dance and vibe out to an array of Latin American DJ sets (lot radio an
 d NTS radio stuff..not live but we'll project them and it will be fun)&nbs
 p\;Tickets:To attend this party you can sign up for our monthly membership
  which gives you two\, $35 credits to use towards Olio events each month.&
 nbsp\;You must be 21 or older to attend.What is Think Olio?Think Olio is a
 n ongoing experiment in lifelong learning. We are a community of open-mind
 ed people who gather to exchange ideas with new friends and connect over a
 rt\, literature\, and philosophy.An Olio is what we call the social learni
 ng events we’ve been organizing since 2015. A blend between a lecture an
 d a house party\, Olios are led by a teacher who loves sharing their passi
 ons and the room is filled with curious\, open-minded New Yorkers.&nbsp\;E
 ight months into creating a venue\, one of our favorite feelings has been 
 the moments where we’ve stepped outside of time. We’ve created a space
  where conversations don’t feel rushed\, people are greeted with hugs\, 
 and as a community\, we spontaneously come up with new ideas (like the dia
 l-up-disco house party) and bring them to life.Our goal is to spark new pe
 rspectives\, ignite curiosity\, and enjoy ourselves socially—an alternat
 ive to typical nightlife options.Check out our full calendarDisclaimer: By
  purchasing a ticket\, you agree to have your photo/video used for social 
 media/marketing materials. If you prefer to not have your photo taken\, fe
 el free to send us a note.\n\nTickets & info: https://www.viewcy.com/event
 /misc_connections_an
URL:https://www.viewcy.com/event/misc_connections_an
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:300a3ef1-1148-4796-9f35-4d424c6a3e37@viewcy.olio
DTSTAMP:20260913T162421Z
DTSTART:20260923T230000Z
DTEND:20260924T013000Z
SUMMARY:Olio Member Salon: Tarot and Oracle Deck Night
DESCRIPTION:Olio Salons are by members for members. Generated by a passion 
 from someone in our community these are social events that create discussi
 on and learning about a new topic each time.To attend this salon you can s
 ign up for our monthly membership which gives you two\, $35 credits to use
  towards Olio events each month. &nbsp\;&nbsp\;Tarot and Oracle Deck Night
  led by member\, Dave Ratzlow. Tarot has been around for centuries\, evolv
 ing from a card game into a tool for reflection\, storytelling\, and divin
 ation. Oracle decks are their freer cousins—no fixed structure\, just en
 dless themes\, creativity\, questions\, and possibilities.Whether or not y
 ou believe in the magical power of cards\, they can be a beautiful catalys
 t for connection\, contemplation\, appreciation\, and fun.This evening is 
 for tarot and oracle deck aficionados and the uninitiated alike. Bring you
 r favorite decks\, trade readings\, explore new spiritual terrain\, or jus
 t come curious.Throughout the evening\, we’ll also begin creating the fi
 rst-ever Olio Oracle Deck. Blank cards and art supplies will be provided s
 o everyone can create their own cards. At the end of the evening\, we’ll
  collectively choose our favorites\, and their creators will go home with 
 a special deck to bring to the next party.Oracle deck nerd and Olio member
  Dave Ratzlow will also offer personal readings throughout the evening.Eve
 ning Flow7:00 PM – Doors open. Settle in\, grab a drink\, and meet someo
 ne new.7:30 PM – The Olio begins: Dave provides a brief history of tarot
  and oracle decks. Members share their favorite decks and favorite ways to
  use them.8:00 PM – Trade readings\, explore new decks\, and discover di
 fferent ways to work with the cards.9:30 PM – We choose the winning card
 s for the Olio Oracle Deck\, enjoy a last drink and wind down the evening.
 &nbsp\;Want to be the next member to lead a salon night? Send us a note!&n
 bsp\;Hi@olio.rsvp&nbsp\;\n\nTickets & info: https://www.viewcy.com/event/o
 lio_member_salon_ta
URL:https://www.viewcy.com/event/olio_member_salon_ta
END:VEVENT
